# {{app_title}}

A [Plotly Dash](https://dash.plotly.com) app, scaffolded with
[dash-init](https://github.com/budescode/dash-init) on {{create_date}}.

## Run it

```bash
python -m venv .venv && source .venv/bin/activate   # Windows: .venv\Scripts\activate
pip install -r requirements.txt
python app.py
```

Or with [uv](https://docs.astral.sh/uv/) (reads `pyproject.toml`):

```bash
uv sync
uv run app.py
```

Then open http://127.0.0.1:8050 in your browser.

## Deploy

**Any WSGI host**: `app.py` exposes `server = app.server`:

```bash
pip install gunicorn
gunicorn app:server
```
